  "description": "MIT-licensed MCP (Model Context Protocol) server that gives AI agents (Claude, Cursor, Copilot, etc.) interactive .NET / ASP.NET Core debugging. Wraps Samsung's netcoredbg over the Debug Adapter Protocol (DAP). 26 tools: launch/attach, breakpoints (line, function, exception, data), stepping, thread inspection, stack traces, expression evaluation, variable mutation, exception autopsy, hang/deadlock analysis, server-side request tracing, and process output capture. Install as a .NET global tool and point any MCP-compatible AI at your running app.",
  "id": "AspNetCoreDebuggerMcp",
